2. Third-party pictures: public domain
---------------------------------------

Every photographed or scanned picture is a public-domain work. Sources, crops and
grading: assets/wallpapers/README.md.

- Katsushika Hokusai, *The Great Wave off Kanagawa* (c. 1831). Wikimedia Commons,
  `Great_Wave_off_Kanagawa2.jpg`. Public domain. (ola.jpg)
- Katsushika Hokusai, *Fine Wind, Clear Morning* (c. 1830-32). Wikimedia Commons,
